// A throwaway Outlook-produced .msg, base64-inlined.
//
// WHY A REAL FILE: every other cfbf/msg test builds its input with our own
// writer, so reader and writer could share the same misreading of MS-CFB and
// agree forever. This fixture is the only thing proving we read what Outlook
// actually emits. unzip.test.ts inlines a real zip for the same reason.
//
// It is deliberately synthetic: sent to self, no real correspondents, no
// business content. Subject 'Ingest fixture', body marker
// FIXTURE-BODY-MARKER, one bold word, a two-row table, and a .txt
// attachment containing 'fixture attachment payload'.
//
// Kept on ONE line deliberately: size:check counts split("\n").length for
// a NEW file against an 800-line ceiling, and wrapping this ~110KB base64
// blob at 76-100 columns would blow past it.
export const MINIMAL_OUTLOOK_MSG_BASE64 = ``;
